/target

# Cargo.lock is intentionally NOT tracked for this example. With the local-deps
# patch off (the committed state), resolution targets crates.io, which CI does
# from a clean checkout. A committed off-state lock would resolve here against a
# sandbox with no registry access; CI regenerates it. Regenerate locally with
# `scripts/examples-local.sh on` then build.
/Cargo.lock
